L	Hellbringer	An ODST flamethrower specialist. Hellbringers clear the Flood out of corridors no one else will enter.
L	Johnson	Sergeant Avery Johnson: veteran, inspiration, and the last man to tell you he is in trouble.
L	Marine	UNSC Marines: the soldiers who stood against the Covenant on every front. They follow a Spartan, take orders, pick up better weapons and carry on fighting while there is breath in them.
L	MarineArmored	Marines in heavier armor, given heavier weapons and harder jobs.
L	MarineODST	Orbital Drop Shock Troopers. They arrive feet first from orbit in drop pods, fight in sealed armor and have a reputation to maintain. Their black armor and dark visors are recognized across the Covenant's front lines.
L	RadioOperator	A Marine radioman. When the fight turns bad, the radio brings reinforcements.
L	Stacker	Sergeant Stacker: a steady hand, never far from his men or his rifle.
